<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-306] Collect N (e.g. 1000) last errors for grid node</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-306</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Many errors in disco or communication are not output to logs (other than debug), e.g. in case when connection has been reestablished. However, this may affect performance badly. We need to collect last errors for components including:&lt;br/&gt;
time&lt;br/&gt;
thread ID and name&lt;br/&gt;
Message&lt;br/&gt;
Stacktrace&lt;br/&gt;
So in case we have strange performance drops we can check last errors.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
